---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: publishSaleResults(claimRoot, acceptedCapitalRoot, totalTokens, totalRaised, privKey)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_locked: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_locked --> q_validate_key: cancelLocked == true
    q_check_locked --> q_revert_not_locked: initializePublishSaleResults not called
    q_validate_key --> q_validate_roots: privKey corresponds to publicKey (key pair validation)
    q_validate_key --> q_revert_key: InvalidPrivateKey
    q_validate_roots --> q_validate_amounts: claimRoot != 0 AND acceptedCapitalRoot != 0
    q_validate_roots --> q_revert_roots: InvalidMerkleRoot
    q_validate_amounts --> q_set_state: totalRaised <= totalInvestedCapital
    q_validate_amounts --> q_revert_amounts: raised exceeds invested
    q_set_state --> q_publish_key: claimMerkleRoot = claimRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot = acceptedCapitalRoot
    q_publish_key --> q_mark_published: privateKey = privKey (enables public bid decryption)
    q_mark_published --> q_emit: resultsPublished = true, totalTokensAllocated = totalTokens, totalCapitalRaised = totalRaised
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleResultsPublished(claimRoot, totalTokens, totalRaised, privKey)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_not_locked --> [*]: revert CancellationNotLocked
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert InvalidPrivateKey
    q_revert_roots --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleRoot
    q_revert_amounts --> [*]: revert InvalidCapitalAmount

    note right of q_publish_key
        INV-001: privateKey release enables public verification of all sealed bids
        INV-002: privKey * G == publicKey (ECIES key pair relationship)
        INV-003: totalCapitalRaised <= totalInvestedCapital
        INV-004: resultsPublished monotonic false->true
    end note
